# Git: master only

- Work, commit, and push on `master` only.
- Do not create or use a `design` (or other feature) branch unless the user explicitly asks.
- When the user says commit/push, push `origin master` so production gets the change.
- Do not merge `design` → `master` as a routine; stay on `master`.
